{
  "summary": "The investigation focuses on an instrument-air pressure loss at ~10:00 AM while a Utilities crew prepared for maintenance. The event involved equipment (compressor/dryer system or distribution infrastructure) but lacks specific data on origin, valve states, and restoration mechanism.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "statement": "An instrument-air low-pressure indication occurred at the RHOB service station while a two-person Utilities crew was preparing for maintenance of the #1 slab caster dryer group (WO-527).",
      "type": "finding",
      "status": "verified","sourceIds":["structuredIncident.focalEvent","IA-S01_shift_and_notification_log.md"],"testNeeded":"None; this is a confirmed event fact."}
    ],
  "questions":[
    {
      "intent":"equipment-condition-and-failure-mode",
      "text": "What was the physical condition of the instrument-air source (compressor), distribution piping, and receiving equipment immediately before and after the pressure drop?",
      "rationale":"To distinguish between a mechanical failure (e.g., compressor trip, valve stuck open/closed, pipe rupture) versus an external influence or sensor fault.",
      "evidenceNeeded":["Maintenance logs for May 20","Compressor run-time/hour records","Visual inspection reports of piping/valves at RHOB and source","Sensor calibration history"],"priority":"high",
      "sourceIds":[],
      "routedTo":[]}, {
    "intent":"equipment-setup-and-configuration",
    "text": "What were the specific valve positions (supply, demand, bypass) in the instrument-air distribution system at RHOB and upstream during the event?",
    "rationale":"Valve configuration determines if a pressure drop was due to isolation for maintenance, an unintended open path, or a closed supply line. This separates setup error from equipment failure.",
      "evidenceNeeded":["P&ID drawings with current valve states","Operator logs of manual overrides"],"priority":"high",
      "sourceIds":[],
      "routedTo":[]}, {
    "intent":"equipment-maintenance-and-history",
    "text": "Had the instrument-air compressors, filters, or regulators at RHOB been inspected or maintained recently (within 30 days), and were any defects reported prior to May 20?",
      "rationale":"To determine if a latent defect (e.g., worn seal, clogged filter) caused the failure. Absence of evidence for recent maintenance does not prove absence of inspection but highlights a gap in records.",
      "evidenceNeeded":["Maintenance work orders","Inspection checklists"],"priority":"medium",
      "sourceIds":[],
      "routedTo":[]}, {
    "intent":"equipment-design-and-specs",
    "text": "What are the design pressure limits, alarm thresholds (numeric values), and automatic restart logic for the instrument-air system at RHOB?",
      "rationale":"The evidence packet states numeric values are unknown. Knowing if 10:02-10:07 restoration was automatic or manual clarifies whether a safety interlock failed or an operator intervened.",
      "evidenceNeeded":["Equipment datasheets","Control logic diagrams"],"priority":"medium",
      "sourceIds":[],
      "routedTo":[]}, {
    "intent":"equipment-external-influence",
    "text": "Were there any concurrent events (power outage, upstream shutdown, utility change order) that could have affected the instrument-air supply to RHOB?",
      "rationale":"External influences often mimic equipment failure. This question screens out systemic causes.",
      "evidenceNeeded":["Utility shift logs","Change management records"],"priority":"medium",
      "sourceIds":[],
      "routedTo":[]}
  ],
  "handoffs":[

  ],"decision":{"summary":"The investigation has confirmed the event (air loss) and its context (maintenance prep). The next step is to determine if the cause was equipment failure, configuration error, or external influence. Evidence gaps include specific valve positions, numeric alarm thresholds, and restoration mechanism.",
    "evidenceUsed":["structuredIncident","IA-S01_shift_and_notification_log.md"],"unknowns":["Origin of pressure drop (source vs distribution)","Valve states during event","Restoration mechanism (auto/manual)"],"alternatives":[

  ],"confidence":0.85}}
